# k-fold cross-validation
scores = cross_val_score(
    LinearRegression(), X, y,
    cv=5,
    scoring='r2'
)

print(f"R² (Mean ± Std): {scores.mean():.3f} ± {scores.std():.3f}")
# More robust than single train-test split
```

**Training vs Test Error:**
