plt.show()

# Looking for: Random scatter, normal distribution, no patterns
```

**Business Metrics:**
```python
# Convert to business context

# MAE in dollars for price prediction
mae_dollars = np.mean(np.abs(y_test - y_pred))
print(f"Average prediction error: ${mae_dollars:.2f}")

# MAPE (Mean Absolute Percentage Error)
