```

**Key Points:**
🔑 Hard margin: Perfect separation, rarely achievable
🔑 Soft margin: Allows violations, practical
🔑 C parameter: Trade-off between violations and margin
🔑 Large C: Fits noise (overfitting)
🔑 Small C: Ignore outliers (underfitting)
🔑 Use CV: Find optimal C for your data

