```

### Davies-Bouldin Index

```
Ratio of within to between cluster distances

Lower is better
Measures cluster separation and compactness

DB_index = (1/k) Σᵢ max_{j≠i} (σᵢ + σⱼ) / d(cᵢ, cⱼ)

where:
σᵢ: Average distance within cluster i
d(cᵢ, cⱼ): Distance between centroids
```

